01:29.776 --> 01:31.180
This three dimensional figure

01:31.180 --> 01:35.869
that we are attempting to visualize.

01:35.969 --> 01:38.456
I'm assuming you've had a go at it.

01:38.456 --> 01:39.983
One way to think about it
is, well let's just think

01:39.983 --> 01:42.766
